<title>Nigeria: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/nigeria/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-nigeria-2026-10-13T00:53:25.656Z</guid>
<pubDate>Tue, 13 Oct 2026 00:53:25 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Bandits continue to target civilians and security forces, killing traders and an immigration officer in Niger and ambushing a convoy in Zamfara, while Fulani militias have hacked and killed Christians in Benue and carried out attacks in Plateau and Niger. Kidnappers have abducted a couple and their infant in Kaduna, prompting Atiku Abubakar to call for their rescue. ISWAP fighters launched an assault on a town in Borno but were repelled after air strikes killed dozens of militants. The conflict produced 1,486 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMinwFBVV95cUxQczFfSFRPOG5EYXJNQTVMa0p2T0JRMXRXS0Npak1lS0x3RkRXVW1IS0xxZGpQQm9Fb1o4WlZwTWYxZmcyTUpOZnRRN05UWlBlMjY1elM0RHYzcUR4WkRuSFJtSkxVZkxBTmt4cDZoYlNtaGlPR1lZQTRTN1dWMTN3TElYenBPT0Jac3M5MVdZa0tPNlVrZ0t6NVUtZEpNQm_SAaYBQVVfeXFMTThsc2tsczlCTG1VX2ZpbW4yNXFMVFktU21lRUNsaDlNWHhOVGZTRVdJOS1faml2M2tkbS1tcnlsVUM4c2xLMDdsbVYyWVFiUWRyUG5PZGhESEtHbGFKaUl2UEV4QmdDd0NwRGsweGFzZWZCRElnNnh3OEs0bzN5bU45a2JFWmJSZHVUWDdjZVM5ZW12SDNFVzNaMWtwclp2bUN3WXl0UQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Hindu&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMijwFBVV95cUxPVWRrV1lkWlNKOWwzQ3hZQ1VZcFhqdjFydFlNSzdTR2wzODNqSXQ5eFExTzJxZG9DbVY0WmUyTV9NUWxIQnhXZTR5N2pJeFNyTXJYSlVGSzd4eGU2OUtJOFlIQ2FGMy1za1o1OU95UkxJbm41eEJJcWhpU3lxMEpmcXhZMTFhajVPNmJsWEYxTQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Daily Trust&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMijAFBVV95cUxPaHBkOXNvY2ZxYVl5SmdfTl85bzJwUVFZTUc5ZWhCc083d0k5V21IS1NUNThpcEJHdXNNQm1mZVM2R3NXRkN2eVJiQlpFYXR0VjVOSlotU04zRWdGQ24yRS1lbjY0eXduYl95bl9wSnVGbHh6YXNsYmRvcWVNVmdoUFN2RXVuSGdGM0ZNYQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Daily Post Nigeria&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMirgFBVV95cUxNVU9FZkVSU3F5Yl9xSDNCZzhuSVFTU3BzR0g2M1o4dzBVbV9jOVgtSHAxNU85bWFna1Y0Z3lNRnNERXoyUjc